        "name": "write_notes",
        "args": {
          "content": "## Landscape Summary\n- 11 systems: corp.itsm, emarsys.cx, my.mes, sap.ariba, sap.crm, sap.ehs, sap.odm, sap.s4, sap.sf, siemens.plm, workday.hcm\n\n## ANALYTICS & REPORTING FOR SERVICETORODUCTION\n- **corp.itsm:agent:IncidentRootCauseAnalyzer:v1** - Generates diagnostic reports, analyzes incident patterns (service resolution), examines equipment status (maintenance patterns), links to change requests (change impact), recommends preventive measures (continuous improvement)\n\n## COMPENSATION RESOURCES (Generic)\n- **workday.hcm:agent:CompensationAdjustmentAutomation:v1** - Merit increases and compensation based on performance/tenure\n- **sap.sf:agent:CompensationPolicyAutomationEngine:v1** - Policy-driven salary adjustments, employee lifecycle changes\n\n## SERVICE REQUEST & ORDER CAPTURE\n- **sap.s4:agent:OpportunityToOrderAutomationEngine** - Converts sales opportunities to customer orders\n- **corp.itsm agents process ServiceTickets** - IncidentRootCauseAnalyzer, IncidentSafetyCoordinator\n- **sap.ariba** - Purchase Order Network API for procurement orders\n\n## SUPPLY CHAIN RISK & COMPLIANCE\n- **sap.ehs:agent:VendorComplianceAutomationOrchestrator:v1** - Validates vendor safety certifications\n- **sap.ariba:agent:SupplierComplianceAndIncidentMonitor:v1** - Supply chain risk mitigation\n- **sap.ariba:agent:MaterialAndEngineeringChangeCoordinator:v1** - Material specs validation\n\n## PRODUCTION MONITORING & INCIDENT ANALYSIS\n- **sap.ehs:agent:IncidentRootCauseAnalyzer:v1** - Analyzes SafetyIncident data, generates RCA reports\n- **siemens.plm:agent:QualityAssuranceAndDefectPrevention:v1** - Monitors Machine/ProductionOrder/QualityInspection\n- **my.mes:agent:ProductionQualityMonitor:v1** - Detects quality deviations\n\n## WORKFORCE & RESOURCE ALLOCATION\n- **sap.sf:agent:SkillsAndCapabilityMatchingOrchestrator:v1** - Matches competencies to projects, NOT service ticket scheduling\n"
